# The fixtures are byte-exact captures of SvtAv1EncApp's stderr stream. The
# progress records are separated by a bare carriage return and no newline, and
# the fact that a scanner splitting on "\n" delivers them as one line is exactly
# what svtav1.go's in-line scan exists for. Disable end-of-line conversion so a
# checkout on any platform keeps the bytes intact; the repository root sets
# `* text=auto`, which would otherwise rewrite them.
*.txt -text
